# p2-shields.drv - C4 slice 1: shield hits, seen from outside the ship.
#
# Verifies: C4 (a)-(c) the shield bubble: on the frames the game draws a
#         shield hit (model 192), one translucent rim-lit bubble round the
#         hit ship in place of the flat circle; it holds still while paused.
# Run:  record once with --pace in --args and --timeout 400 (docs/hd/weapons.md,
#       Shield hits), then replay the tape to capture frames; the tape lives
#       outside git.  Unpaced, the waits drift and the return fire may not land.
# Expect: the ship hovering over its port in the external view; after three
#         bursts of its own laser the port's patrols answer with beams, and
#         each hit its shields take shows a bubble round it until they are
#         gone; then a train of short pauses, some landing on a hit.
# Start 2 (landed), new game only: remove the beam laser for the cash,
# fit a pulse laser and a shield generator, lift off.
wait 6000
key space
wait 2000
key 2
# Comms, shipyard, upgrades; More to the last page; remove the beam laser.
wait 11000
mouse 57 193
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 270 52
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 170 58
click 200
wait 2000
mouse 298 160
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
click 150
wait 400
